        <p>REL/G/01/</p>
        <p>Archdeacon's Visitation.</p>
        <p>The following is the route of Archdeacon Spooner's visitation this year : Thursday, May 2od—Warrington : St. Elphin's, 11 a.m. St. Helens: St. Mary's, 3.30 p.m, Friday, May 3rd—Liverpool : St. Luke's 10 a.m. and 4 p.m. For the convenience of those wardens and sidesmen who may be unable to appear at the court to which they are cited above' the archdeacon will hold an extra court at St. Luke's Church, Liverpool, on Friday, May 3, at 7.30 o'clock p.m.</p>
