        <p>INSTANT RELIEF RAPID CURE of GOUT AND RHEUMATISM by IEADIE'S PILLS. COULD NOT SLEEP WITH PAIN! Woodfall Hill, Downton, Salisbury. April 30th, 1911. Dear Sir,—Having used your pills for three years and reaped so much benefit from them I think it my duty to give you a testimonial. Now this last week I had rheumatic gout come in my hand and then in my foot I COULD Nor SLEEP WITH THE PAIN, and the swelling. I had no pills at the time and could not walk. I sent and got a bottle and took two in the morning and by night I WALKED TWO MILES! I always recommend your pills to others and tell them what good they do me. You may use this how you like. Yours truly, F. GOULD. EADE'S GOUT PILLS Are perfectly safe in their action, eliminate all injurious matter, and are highly restorative. Sold everywhere in bottles Is. lid. and 2s. 9d. or sent post free for stamps or P.O.by the proprietor, GEORGE BADE, 232, Goswell road, London. GrOUTI</p>
